                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>01</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#7C3AED' }}>第 1 步</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E1B4B', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 12 }}>A 写决策不写流水账，反例「负责调研、PRD、跟开发、测试验收」</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 222, height: 470, paddingTop: 18, paddingBottom: 18, paddingLeft: 18, paddingRight: 18, background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
