                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E1B4B', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 12 }}>正例两条决策（推翻原假设放弃换模型；延迟换正确率）</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 222, height: 470, paddingTop: 18, paddingBottom: 18, paddingLeft: 18, paddingRight: 18, background: '#F5F3FF', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 26, height: 26, borderRadius: 13, background: '#7C3AED', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
