                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#7C3AED' }}>第 3 步</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E1B4B', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 12 }}>R 基准→结果 + 时间范围，反例「效果显著，广受好评」</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 222, height: 470, paddingTop: 18, paddingBottom: 18, paddingLeft: 18, paddingRight: 18, background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
