                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E1B4B', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 12 }}>数字不好看也要写，一票否决的是造假不是数字小</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 222, height: 470, paddingTop: 18, paddingBottom: 18, paddingLeft: 18, paddingRight: 18, background: '#F5F3FF', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
